url: "https://github.com/Obediko/cognitive-spatial-battery"
abstract: >-
  Research-only browser software implementing original English and German
  pilot tasks for cognitive and spatial assessment, pseudonymous participant
  administration, data export, and separated examiner review. Its outputs are
  experimental analogues. They are not validated clinical measures, official
  source instruments, or norm-equivalent scores.
